<!-- render-gate:start -->
## Video rendering rules
- Never run `remotion render` directly. Always run `npx render-gate render <Composition>`.
- After editing a composition, asset, or spec, run `npx render-gate check <Composition> --json`.
- On failure, read `reason`, `stage`, and `evidence`; fix the composition and rerun.
- Do not render until check passes. Do not loosen specs to make a failing check pass.
- Creative decisions are yours; gate checks technical preview state only.
<!-- render-gate:end -->
